# The leakage follows the profile that emits a Gaussian matched to the fibre, up to what the etch can provide.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Gaussian-apodised grating, leakage limited to 0.8 per um
grating angle=10 length=30
leak 0.8
apodise gaussian
expect radiated 0.99873711 1e-06
expect overlap 0.99994056 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.49933888 2e-05
expect position 15.00041743 0.005
expect efficiency_db -3.01605 0.0005
